2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (Lead\055free\040perovskites\072\040growth\054\040properties\054\040and\040applications)
/Author (Fan\040Yang\054\040Fan\040Yang\054\040Aocheng\040Wang\054\040Aocheng\040Wang\054\040Shuai\040Yue\054\040Shuai\040Yue\054\040Wenna\040Du\054\040Wenna\040Du\054\040Shaoli\040Wang\054\040Xiaotao\040Zhang\054\040Xinfeng\040Liu\054\040Xinfeng\040Liu)
/Subject (Lead\040halide\040perovskites\040have\040attracted\040extensive\040attention\040in\040recent\040years\040because\040of\040their\040excellent\040photoelectronic\040properties\054\040such\040as\040high\040absorption\040coefficients\054\040carrier\040mobilities\054\040defect\040tolerances\054\040and\040photoluminescence\040efficiencies\056\040However\054\040a\040key\040issue\040hindering\040their\040commercial\040application\040is\040the\040toxicity\040of\040lead\056\040Replacing\040lead\040with\040other\040nontoxic\040elements\040is\040a\040promising\040solution\040to\040this\040problem\056\040Considering\040their\040atomic\040radii\054\040relative\040atomic\040masses\054\040and\040electron\040arrangements\054\040perovskites\040based\040on\040Sn\054\040Bi\054\040Sb\054\040and\040other\040elements\040instead\040of\040Pb\040have\040been\040widely\040synthesized\056\040Here\054\040we\040summarized\040the\040growth\040methods\054\040photoelectric\040properties\054\040and\040device\040applications\040of\040these\040lead\055free\040perovskites\056\040First\054\040we\040introduced\040several\040common\040growth\040methods\040for\040lead\055free\040perovskites\054\040including\040solution\040methods\054\040solid\055state\040reaction\054\040and\040chemical\040vapor\040deposition\040methods\056\040Second\054\040we\040discussed\040the\040photoelectric\040properties\040and\040methods\040for\040optimizing\040these\040properties\040of\040lead\055free\040perovskites\040with\040different\040structure\040dimensions\056\040Finally\054\040the\040applications\040of\040lead\055free\040perovskites\040in\040solar\040cells\054\040light\055emitting\040diodes\054\040and\040X\055ray\040detectors\040were\040examined\056\040This\040review\040also\040provides\040suggestions\040for\040future\040research\040on\040lead\055free\040perovskites\056)
/Keywords (27\040Aug\0402021\054\040Science\040China\056\040Materials\054\040Center\040for\040Excellence\040in\040Education\054\040Tianjin\040University\054\040Chinese\040Academy\040of\040Sciences)
>>
endobj
